  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Aggressive/Violent Nature",
  "description": "The meme invokes a violent, degrading physical assault ('kick in the nuts') as a hypothetical question directed at Barack and Michelle Obama, a Black couple in a position of power. This implicitly relies on the racist stereotype that Black people are inherently aggressive or violent, which is used to justify or normalize the violent metaphor. The meme uses this stereotype to demean the Obamas by associating them with a violent act, thereby reinforcing racial prejudice.",
